<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 26/27.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 26/27.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Wednesday</p>
<p>set the following exchange rates for June 26/27. Estonian kroon</p>
<p>is pegged to German mark at 8:1.</p>
<p>		  June 26     June 20</p>
<p>    CZK	 0.43337     0.43133</p>
<p>    DKK	 2.10025     2.10016</p>
<p>    FIM	 2.67005     2.67113</p>
<p>    GBP	22.90302    22.76133</p>
<p>    HUF	 0.07433     0.0745</p>
<p>    LTL	 3.44306     0.00818</p>
<p>    LVL	24.18337    24.20324</p>
<p>    RUR	 0.00239     0.0024</p>
<p>    SEK	 1.7887	1.7883</p>
<p>    UAH	 7.42053     7.43688</p>
<p>    USD	13.7688     13.814</p>
<p>    XEU	15.67371    15.65472</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
